       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p style=\"max-width:615px;\">We work with businesses across the Sunshine Coast and beyond to help them cut through\n        the noise and connect with their audience on an emotional level. Whether you need video\n        marketing for social media, YouTube, emails to customers or for your website, our content\n        is designed to get you results.</p><p style=\"max-width:615px;\">Our team is highly experienced in video capture, production and strategic content\n        delivery. From start to finish, let our experienced team deliver the results you want.</p>",
