    {
     "id": "0f39156a",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p style=\"max-width:615px;\">When we create videos for your marketing needs, we think about the real reason you need\n      this video. Whether it's product sales, brand awareness, enquiries, or client acquisition,\n      your goal is our main focus throughout the entire project.</p><p style=\"max-width:615px;\">That's what takes your video project from simple content to a business growth tool — and\n      we deliver effective video campaigns that drive sales, traffic and engagement.</p>",
