      "editor": "<p style=\"max-width:615px;\">Pepper Productions is a division of the Sunshine Coast's leading marketing agency Chilli,\n        which has been achieving great results for businesses since 1993.</p><p style=\"max-width:615px;\">This partnership allows our in-house team of storytellers to get the best results from\n        your content. Be it online, on social media, or for corporate and trade events, we make\n        sure your project is on time, on budget and — most importantly — that it gets results.</p>",
