    {
     "id": "1316f58a",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p style=\"max-width:615px;\">We run two. The first is a fully-kitted 4X4 adventure van, hard to come by in\n        Australia, built for remote location shooting and overnight stays on bigger productions\n        — solar panels, lithium batteries, shore power and a 3000W inverter, so there's never a\n        wait on charge halfway through a shoot.</p><p style=\"max-width:615px;\">The second is a 2026 Transit Custom Trail: our dedicated day-to-day production and grip\n        van, smaller and easier to place on a tight job, still tough enough for a work site.</p><p style=\"max-width:615px;\">They keep the kit in prime condition and give everyone somewhere to review footage,\n        get changed, sit in the shade and get a coffee. On a long day outdoors, that is not a\n        small thing.</p>",
      "text_color": "#55575C",
      "typography_typography": "custom",
      "typography_font_family": "Montserrat",
      "typography_font_size": {
       "unit": "px",
       "size": 16
